# The agent kit's skill files, which show example annotations about the hotel
# examples. They'd otherwise be read as Docqet's own evidence. Only their
# Markdown is left out, so the Go code beside it can still be annotated.
# Docqet's own docs need no entry: annotations are never read from a Docqet
# doc, so the concept docs can show examples freely.
/kit/**/*.md

# The agent kit's skill, written by docqet kit. Its examples aren't this project's.
/.claude/skills/docqet/**/*.md
